{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "1CH",
 "chapter": 6,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.8",
   "range": "1CH.6.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c92b7bc5",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.8#p1-c92b7bc5",
     "text": "Who was high priest after Abiathar was deposed, according to the prophecy of Eli the priest, 1Sa 2:31,35.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "Zadok",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Sa 2:31,35",
       "ref": "1SA.2.31"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Sa 2:31,35",
       "ref": "1SA.2.35"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.10",
   "range": "1CH.6.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9860dc4d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.10#p1-9860dc4d",
     "text": "And valiantly resisted king Uzziah, who would have usurped the priest's office 2Ch 26:17,18.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "priest's office in the temple that",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ch 26:17,18",
       "ref": "2CH.26.17"
      },
      {
       "text": "2Ch 26:17,18",
       "ref": "2CH.26.18"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.15",
   "range": "1CH.6.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "63cf9c88",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.15#p1-63cf9c88",
     "text": "That is, he was led into captivity with his father Seraiah the high priest, 2Ki 25:18.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "Jehozadak went into captivity",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ki 25:18",
       "ref": "2KI.25.18"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.22",
   "range": "1CH.6.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7d531d54",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.22#p1-7d531d54",
     "text": "Who seems to be called Izhar, Ex 6:21.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "Amminadab his son",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 6:21",
       "ref": "EXO.6.21"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.28",
   "range": "1CH.6.28",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6c415cbb",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.28#p1-6c415cbb",
     "text": "Who is also called Joel, 1Sa 8:2, 1Ch 6:33.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "Vashni",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Sa 8:2, 1Ch 6:33",
       "ref": "1SA.8.2"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Sa 8:2, 1Ch 6:33",
       "ref": "1CH.6.33"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.31",
   "range": "1CH.6.31",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e28990f2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.31#p1-e28990f2",
     "text": "After it was brought to the place where the temple would be built and was no longer carried to and fro.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "rest"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.39",
   "range": "1CH.6.39",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c3690086",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.39#p1-c3690086",
     "text": "Meaning, the son of Heman, 1Ch 6:33.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "Asaph",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 6:33",
       "ref": "1CH.6.33"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.48",
   "range": "1CH.6.48",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "524cf3aa",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.48#p1-a3047885",
     "text": "The Levites are called the singers brothers because they came from the same stock.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "brethren also the Levites were"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.48#p2-534942f4",
     "text": "Read Nu 4:4.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "appointed unto all manner of service",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Nu 4:4",
       "ref": "NUM.4.4"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.54",
   "range": "1CH.6.54",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a694d51d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.54#p1-7a9009fd",
     "text": "Or, cities which were given to the Levites.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "dwelling places throughout their castles in"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.54#p2-5b1b7b81",
     "text": "They were first appointed, and prepared for.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "lot"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.55",
   "range": "1CH.6.55",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "cc32aa6f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.55#p1-cc32aa6f",
     "text": "Which was also called Kirjatharba, Ge 23:2, Jos 21:11.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "Hebron in the land of Judah",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ge 23:2, Jos 21:11",
       "ref": "GEN.23.2"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ge 23:2, Jos 21:11",
       "ref": "JOS.21.11"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.57",
   "range": "1CH.6.57",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "308bf7d2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.57#p1-308bf7d2",
     "text": "That he that had killed a man might flee to it for help till his case was tried, De 19:2.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "refuge",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "De 19:2",
       "ref": "DEU.19.2"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.58",
   "range": "1CH.6.58",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "bb7c8f01",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.58#p1-bb7c8f01",
     "text": "Which Joshua called Holon, Jos 15:51,21:15.",
     "label": "p",
     "anchor": "Hilen with her suburbs",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Jos 15:51,21:15",
       "ref": "JOS.15.51"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jos 15:51,21:15",
       "ref": "JOS.21.15"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.60",
   "range": "1CH.6.60",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5b78074d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.60#p1-5b78074d",
     "text": "Or, Almon Jos 21:18.",
     "label": "q",
     "anchor": "Alemeth with her suburbs",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Jos 21:18",
       "ref": "JOS.21.18"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.61",
   "range": "1CH.6.61",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0a336e7c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.61#p1-0a336e7c",
     "text": "That is, they gave a portion to the Kohathites, who were the remnant of the tribe of Levi, out of the half tribe of Manasseh and out of Ephraim, 1Ch 6:66.",
     "label": "r",
     "anchor": "Kohath",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 6:66",
       "ref": "1CH.6.66"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.6.71",
   "range": "1CH.6.71",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c16527c9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.6.71#p1-c16527c9",
     "text": "Who in the first verse is also called Gershon.",
     "label": "s",
     "anchor": "Gershom were given out of the"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
